      "writtenOn": "2021-06-30T18:45:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As an example:\n\nUser sets up platform VPN (or VCN) over cellular data\nUser downloads 100MB using Chrome\nUser checks mobile data usage, total usage is correct (increased by 100MB + Overhead), but app data shows chrome has used 0 data\n\nThe above example is because there is per-app data usage to migrate from the underlying network and associated owner to attribute across other apps.\n\nSolution is to migrate based on the usage of the TUN for the platform VPN case. We lose overhead, but this is the most accurate we can get without significant kernel changes.",
      "parentUuid": "aecc6aad_917bad81",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 13,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 13,
        "endChar": 14
      },
      "revId": "997b96fecec13ef594df6250084b1c5a67a96972",
